Package: argon-power-profiles
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Playx <playx@argon-oneup.local>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/argon40tech/argon-oneup
Depends: python3, python3-dbus, python3-gi, iw, systemd
Provides: power-profiles-daemon, rpi-power-profiles
Conflicts: power-profiles-daemon
Replaces: power-profiles-daemon
Description: Hardware Power Profiles Daemon for Raspberry Pi & Argon ONE UP
 Drop-in replacement for power-profiles-daemon on ARM64 and Raspberry Pi devices
 where ACPI platform drivers are absent.
 Exports standard org.freedesktop.UPower.PowerProfiles and net.hadess.PowerProfiles
 D-Bus APIs for KDE Plasma, GNOME, and powerprofilesctl.
 Dynamically manages:
  - CPU Governors (powersave @ 1500MHz, ondemand dynamic, performance @ max freq)
  - WiFi Power Saving (powersave on / off)
  - Display Backlight with per-profile memory and automatic restore
